{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/15/itm_afcb311863187516/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20245","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-10-15T02:50:00Z","content_hash":"d15404c5b69bde5bb9eace93301f63f0d0edd55db20b3de170ecb2834fc36c16","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission metadata","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20245"},{"label":"arXiv HTML full text","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2610.20245v1"},{"label":"Official P2Patch code repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/P2Patch/P2patch"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.20245v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T02:50:00Z","fingerprint":"d15404c5b69bde5bb9eace93301f63f0d0edd55db20b3de170ecb2834fc36c16","id":"itm_afcb311863187516","item_id":"itm_afcb311863187516","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-14T14:19:21Z","sort_at":"2026-10-14T14:19:21Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"P2Patch 是 2026-10-14 发布的 AI for Security 论文，研究自动漏洞修复不能只用构造补丁时见过的 PoV 自证正确这一 oracle-reuse 问题。它让 exploiter 先构造并执行 bootstrap PoV、patcher 修复代码，再由 exploiter 对已接受补丁搜索同漏洞的 distinct bypass；每个执行确认的绕过被累积为永久修复约束，最终用与构造阶段隔离的 fix-closed 和 residual oracle 评分。VulnRepairBench 覆盖 101 个 C/C++ 与 Java CVE、61 个仓库和 20 类 weakness；41% 的运行在原 PoV 已被阻断后仍找到新的确认绕过。相对同 finding 的单次 Claude Code 修复，held-out fix-closed coverage 从 78.1% 升至 84.7%，beyond-upstream residual coverage 从 42.1% 升至 62.5%。局限是 oracle 只覆盖已认证路径、收益受模型与预算影响、公共 CVE 可能存在预训练记忆，且评测容器不构成对恶意仓库的完整隔离。","tags":["ai-safety","ai-for-security","vulnerability-repair","agentic-repair","counterexample-guided-synthesis","security-oracle","CVE"],"title":"P2Patch: Exploit-Guided Vulnerability Repair","title_hash":"1dcc0b3e20b34b930a5cdd5177026ad145fc0c36ed55c50c2a8e54cbc2bb457d","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20245"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/12/itm_9b99dac7607853de/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.16152","category_id":"llm-post-training","collected_at":"2026-10-15T02:45:01Z","content_hash":"320fe522b7ef47d8e0ec354642920d44e1530f4ced06929f673dbfb1c0f1a59a","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission history","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.16152"},{"label":"arXiv HTML full text","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2610.16152"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.16152","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T02:45:01Z","fingerprint":"320fe522b7ef47d8e0ec354642920d44e1530f4ced06929f673dbfb1c0f1a59a","id":"itm_9b99dac7607853de","item_id":"itm_9b99dac7607853de","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-12T04:21:53Z","sort_at":"2026-10-12T04:21:53Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"WildTrace 在开放 Olmo-3-7B 上复现 SFT、DPO、GRPO 三阶段后训练，以同分布、可验证成员标签的数学/代码/指令/问答评测集检验训练数据检测。训练总量超250万样本，比较多类输入和输出检测器；最优 Min-K%++ 平均 AUC 仅0.529，10万样本时 TPR@5%FPR 低于0.1。域漂移可将结果虚高最多21.2%，甚至两个非成员集合间 AUC 达0.908；局限是仅覆盖开放7B模型与受控数据谱系，且实际部署常缺少同分布阈值校准集。","tags":["post-training","membership-inference","data-provenance","ai-safety","benchmark"],"title":"WildTrace: Evaluating Training Data Detection in Realistic Large-Scale LLM Post-Training","title_hash":"8d82a9e2495c184df3e0fc468f466c43a493258d0927ee5decd6e44305ecd8aa","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.16152"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/15/itm_1ae4079228cce30a/index.md","canonical_url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/distillation-defenses","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-10-15T14:53:41Z","content_hash":"068941b529076f1f103f5a75f65b24b55943ab02e38a0e3de382990b8b4ec49c","evidence":[{"label":"Anthropic official report","type":"url","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/distillation-defenses"},{"label":"Anthropic preserved thinking documentation","type":"url","url":"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/extended-thinking#preserved-thinking"},{"label":"Anthropic Constitutional Classifiers research","type":"url","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/constitutional-classifiers"}],"external_id":"Anthropic-distillation-defenses-2026-10-12","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T14:53:41Z","fingerprint":"068941b529076f1f103f5a75f65b24b55943ab02e38a0e3de382990b8b4ec49c","id":"itm_1ae4079228cce30a","item_id":"itm_1ae4079228cce30a","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-12T00:00:00Z","sort_at":"2026-10-12T00:00:00Z","source_id":"anthropic-research","source_name":"Anthropic Research","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"Anthropic 的 2026-10-12 官方报告讨论如何降低针对 Claude 隐藏推理的非法蒸馏：以推理流向约束、两阶段提取分类器和账户级限额/封禁/收费组成三层防线。受控蒸馏中，使用完整 Opus 4.8 推理训练的学生模型在 SWE-bench Verified 达 80.4%，只用摘要化推理为 71.8%；作者称分类器上线后平台内可提取推理 token 降 10–100 倍、误报率低于 0.1%。这些是供应商自报的特定设置与运营观测，未公开分类器、攻击集、绝对 token 量、各层消融或独立审计，且作者承认尚未面对高度复杂且持续的规避攻击。","tags":["ai-safety","distillation","reasoning-security","abuse-prevention"],"title":"Strengthening our defenses against distillation attacks","title_hash":"6a32ac08faa8c9d739586eaf729b30ab49ac0acfa5b7e94d08eac2de1ae8d004","type":"report","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/distillation-defenses"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/15/itm_0f7dfcfdc1f9f405/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.17457","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-10-15T09:30:00Z","content_hash":"4b0e443f2e57bf722c2ec6ad9ff33b8a9d1c040fe7799e87f5c3946b97ff2984","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv paper","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.17457"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.17457v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:30:00Z","fingerprint":"4b0e443f2e57bf722c2ec6ad9ff33b8a9d1c040fe7799e87f5c3946b97ff2984","id":"itm_0f7dfcfdc1f9f405","item_id":"itm_0f7dfcfdc1f9f405","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-12T00:00:00Z","reading_minutes":18,"sort_at":"2026-10-12T00:00:00Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"BrowseSafe++ 把浏览器提示注入扩展为 38,675 组攻击/干净网页对，提供 HTML、Markdown、无障碍树和截图及任务目标。其 0.8B Guard 在文本三视图达到 92.98–98.29 F1、1.35%–7.40% 良性误报，截图为 93.32 F1/6.08% FPR；但独立检测并不保证任务执行时拒绝，Adapt 在最多 64 次反馈改写后将七个 Agent 的攻击成功率从 0.49%–4.00% 提升至 30.66%–95.41%。结论受模型筛选/重写的数据分布、特定验证器与攻击预算限制。","tags":["prompt-injection","browser-agent","benchmark","agent-security","multimodal"],"title":"BrowseSafe++: Benchmarking Prompt Injection Detection Across Web Contexts, Languages, and Browser Views","title_hash":"129773136fa0ce86a8568bd0ee84e946bf403199755d8c8472812c9d55c072a0","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.17457"}
